श्रु श्रृणो॑ति श्रृणुते॑ pp. श्रुत॑ (q.v.) hear, learn
(acc.) from (gen., abl., instr., & मुखात् or श्रकाशात्);
 hear — to
be (2 acc.);
 listen or give ear to (acc. of th. or gen. of pers.);
 hear
a teacher i.e. learn, study. M.P. be heard of, be known as or to be (2
nom.);
 be studied, taught, or read. C. श्रव॑यति & शाव॑यति (˚ते)
cause a person to hear, i.e. address, inform of, communicate to, tell
(acc. of thing & acc., gen., or dat. of pers.);
 let hear i.e. proclaim,
announce, recite. D. श्रु॑शूषते (˚ति) wish or like to hear i.e. attend
to, obey, wait on, serve (acc.). — अति M. be heard of i.e. be
celebrated above (all). अनु hear or learn (again);
 C. relate, tell (2
acc.);
 D.M. obey. अभि hear, learn — to be (2 acc.). C. cause to
hear, speak to, address (acc.). आ listen to (acc. of th., gen. or dat.
of pers.);
 hear, learn;
 promise. C. proclaim, make known;
 address,
invoke, summon. अभ्या C. address. उप listen to (acc. or gen.),
hear, learn from (मुखात् or सकाशात्), hear that — is (2 acc.).
समुप hear, listen to (acc. or gen.), learn from (abl.). परि hear,
learn, understand that—is (2 acc.). प्र M. be heard;
 become known or
famous. प्रति listen or give ear;
 say yes, promise. C. answer. वि
hear, learn;
 P. be heard of, become known or famous. C. let hear,
announce, proclaim, tell;
 make known or famous, make resound. सम् hear
(मुखात्), listen
[]
to (acc.);
 accede to the request of, make a
promise to (loc. or dat.). C. let hear, announce, proclaim;
 make
resound. अभिसम् hear, learn. प्रतिसम् make a promise to (gen.). —
Cf. अभिविशुत, अभिशुत॑, आशुत, परिशुत, वि॑शुत.

स्रु स्र॑वति (स्र॑व˚ते), pp. स्रुत flow, stream;
 flow
with (instr. or acc.);
 drip, leak (vessel);
 flow or waste away, perish,
be lost. C. स्रावयति & स्रवयति cause to flow, spill, shed. — अति
flow over. अधि flow off (abl.). अभि flow hither. अव flow down;
C. = अन्वव C. cause to flow down. आ & उप flow towards (acc.).
नि flow down. निस् flow asunder or out, flow forth, rise from (abl).
परि flow around or abundantly;
 run away, pass (time). प्र flow
forth, stream from (abl.);
 let
[]
flow, discharge. अभिप्र &
संप्र stream forth. वि stream forth, flow from (abl.);
 let flow,
discharge;
 melt away, perish. सम् flow or run together.

श्रुतिपथ m. range of hearing;
 ˚पथं गम्, प्राप्,
etc. come within hearing.

श्रुष्टि॑ a. obedient, ready;
 f. obedience, readiness,
instr. श्रुष्टी॑ readily, quickly. श्रुष्टि॑ कृ obey, follow.

श्रु॑ष्टि a. obedient, ready;
 f. obedience, readiness, instr.
श्रुष्टी॑ readily, quickly. श्रुष्टि॑ कृ obey, follow.
